R5900 MMI embolden smoke test
============================

Build and run this host-side deterministic *emulation* test:

    cc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -fsanitize=address,undefined \
       tests/mmi_embolden_equivalence.c -o mmi-embolden-test
    ./mmi-embolden-test

It models QFSRV (SA=120), unsigned saturating PADDUB, and POR at the
byte level and compares the horizontal and vertical processing order
with the original scalar loops.  It covers 36,000 cases, including
all 16 byte offsets, short/long rows, and scalar fallbacks.

IMPORTANT: This test does NOT execute MMI instructions.  Build the library
with an actual R5900 toolchain and validate pixel-perfect rendering on EE
hardware or a suitable emulator before claiming machine-code correctness
or a performance improvement.
